# Check text out with LF on every platform. Golden fixtures are compared
# byte-for-byte with serializer output, and shell scripts and hooks must not
# carry CRLF; Windows runners default to core.autocrlf=true and would rewrite
# both. Binary assets are listed explicitly so they are never normalised.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
